OL,3,GNEWSAHarry and Meghan arrive in
OL,4,ANottingham for first joint engagement
OL,5,Asince UK return
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are
OL,8,Fvisiting Nottingham on Thursday, in
OL,9,Ftheir first royal-style joint
OL,10,Fengagement since returning to the UK
OL,12,FHarry and Meghan are in the city where
OL,13,Fthey made their first joint appearance
OL,14,Fafter announcing their engagement in
OL,15,F2017
OL,17,FThe pair are due to visit a number of
OL,18,Forganisations, including a community
OL,19,Frecording studio that Harry has been to
OL,20,Fbefore, most recently in 2025
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
